{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/PhysicsMayhemGif.gif?t=1740754871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WOFG! blends motion capture animations with real time physics. According to top goblin scientists, the simulation is 100% accurate when compared to real-world goblin physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/PrecisePlatformingGif.gif?t=1740754871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a ragdoll controller like no other! Take precise control of your goblin on land and while airborne! Aim your feet at the ground for a clean landing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/CoopGif.gif?t=1740754871\" />There is no feeling more heartwarming than throwing your friends down a mountain, and knowing they would do the same for you. Grab your best bud and experience WOFG! In splitscreen. Double the Goblins? Half the problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/SludgeGif.gif?t=1740754871\" />What the heck is up with all this sludge? Seems like a cataclysmic and plot-defining mystery.\u00a0<br>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth and save Gobland? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/WishlistGif.gif?t=1740754871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887920?t=1740754871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740754871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/4569805ce315e6b81510d1210383ac97c15f05e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740754871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/4569805ce315e6b81510d1210383ac97c15f05e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740754871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3256550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/PhysicsMayhemGif.gif?t=1740754871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WOFG! blends motion capture animations with real time physics. According to top goblin scientists, the simulation is 100% accurate when compared to real-world goblin physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/PrecisePlatformingGif.gif?t=1740754871\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a ragdoll controller like no other! Take precise control of your goblin on land and while airborne! Aim your feet at the ground for a clean landing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_p